  "name": "GitHub #39: Search inside embeds in Live Preview",
  "description_html": "<p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"63008296-bcee-480a-8c63-70a2b82e773a\">Source: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-accent-secondary underline underline-offset-[3px] hover:text-accent-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer\" href=\"https://github.com/Jasper-1024/block-link-plus/issues/39\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub issue #39</a></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"72a1cb9f-da28-4616-8458-875480417591\">Feature request: allow Obsidian search to find text inside embedded blocks, headings, and notes while in Live Preview. Obsidian currently supports this in Reading View. Design intake must clarify search ownership, scope, and compatibility before implementation.</p>",
